/-! ### The five isotypic projections (24-scaled over `ℤ`)

`Z₁, …, Z₅` are `24 Q` for the five isotypic projections of the
carrier: trivial (dim 1), two-dimensional `(V₂)₊` (dim 2),
even standard `W₊ = C` (dim 3), odd standard `W₋ = G` — the cut
space (dim 3) — and the sign-twisted `(W ⊗ sgn)₋ = P_loop` — the
cycle space (dim 3). -/

def Z1 : Matrix E E ℤ :=
  2 • 1 + 2 • RmZ + 2 • NmZ + 2 • MmZ + 2 • DisZ
def Z2 : Matrix E E ℤ :=
  4 • 1 + 4 • RmZ - 2 • NmZ - 2 • MmZ + 4 • DisZ
def Z3 : Matrix E E ℤ := 6 • 1 + 6 • RmZ - 6 • DisZ
def Z4 : Matrix E E ℤ := 6 • 1 - 6 • RmZ + 3 • NmZ - 3 • MmZ
def Z5 : Matrix E E ℤ := 6 • 1 - 6 • RmZ - 3 • NmZ + 3 • MmZ

